imation: none !important;\n+  transition: none !important;\n+}\n+\n .teach-next-box {\n   background: var(--bg-subtle);\n   padding: 11px 15px;\n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
